    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the bees collect enough honey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill the jug with honey to complete the level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remove obstacles and solve puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By purchasing the game you will receive:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- an exciting puzzle with the mechanics of creating a path for liquid and passing obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- interesting and varied levels, with increasing difficulty and new obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- satisfaction from solving puzzles and passing levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In general, you will find an interesting and relaxing puzzle (with unusual mechanics and cute graphics), which will allow you to while away the time, test your puzzle solving skills and enjoy the charming theme of bees.</p>",
